23
00:00:56.640 --> 00:00:59.160
A test set is a fixed list of

24
00:00:59.160 --> 00:01:00.600
requests with their right

25
00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:02.680
answers, kept out of training.

26
00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:05.300
Run it again after every change,

27
00:01:05.640 --> 00:01:07.100
and you’ll know whether the agent

28
00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:08.420
got better or worse.

29
00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:12.830
In the evals lab, Darsi Tiny scores

30
00:01:12.830 --> 00:01:14.730
